# "A +1/+1 counter on that token for each permanent you own that your opponents control", counted as the reflexive ability
# resolves. Turn 5: Bot1 gives away the Food token (Ally 1: one owned permanent under Bot2, so 2/2). Turn 7: Bot1 gives
# away the Mountain it owns; Bot2 now controls two permanents Bot1 owns (Food, Mountain), so Ally 2 gets two counters: 3/3.
# Bot2's own Plains and Bot1's Iroh, Plains and Allies are not counted.

